* @title Recursive pattern definition for balanced strings
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Chapter 2
* @expect >>>
* 0
* ((A+B*C))
* ((A+B*C))+
* ((A+B*C))+D
* 1
* (A+B*C)
* 2
* A
* A+
* A+B
* A+B*
* A+B*C
* 3
* +
* +B
* +B*
* +B*C
* 4
* B
* B*
* B*C
* 5
* *
* *C
* 6
* C
* 7
* 8
* 9
* +
* +D
* 10
* D
* <<<
         BALEXP = NOTANY('()') | '(' ARBNO(*BALEXP) ')'
         BAL = BALEXP ARBNO(BALEXP)
         '((A+B*C))+D' @OUTPUT BAL $ OUTPUT FAIL
END
